    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/26ed585dfcb696508563093e49767d45.poster.avif?t=1734717340\" width=800 height=297 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/26ed585dfcb696508563093e49767d45.webm?t=1734717340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspicious Holes is a stylized roguelike card game dungeon crawler with horror undertones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/d1ad31f66c9bd705e1f593dee7d24b1f.poster.avif?t=1734717340\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/d1ad31f66c9bd705e1f593dee7d24b1f.webm?t=1734717340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/d1ad31f66c9bd705e1f593dee7d24b1f.mp4?t=1734717340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Suspicious Holes you will:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play the Suspicious Holes card game against darkly eccentric masked characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >win to unlock new locations and opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience an ever changing setting where the cards are never the same. Every play through is unique in this roguelike experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >traverse bizarrely stylized locations and tackle puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/40401cad99fcb5b2997cdb23625bb540.poster.avif?t=1734717340\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/40401cad99fcb5b2997cdb23625bb540.webm?t=1734717340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/40401cad99fcb5b2997cdb23625bb540.mp4?t=1734717340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/de81e537de7aa4ae984f79ed7e7b9235.poster.avif?t=1734717340\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/de81e537de7aa4ae984f79ed7e7b9235.webm?t=1734717340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360280/extras/de81e537de7aa4ae984f79ed7e7b9235.mp4?t=1734717340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
